   "urlId": "holiday-desserts",
   "title": "Holiday Specialty Dessert Pre-Order - For Pickup Only",
   "body": null,
   "excerpt": "<h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">SOLD OUT FOR THE SEASON</h2><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Lux Cookie Gift Box: 4 of each cookie</h4><ol data-rte-list=\"true\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Lemon Wedding Cake Cookie: filled with lemon curd, dipped in dark chocolate</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Alfajores: shortbread cookie with dulce de leche filling</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Babes: palmier style cookie filled with dulce de leche filling</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Almond Shortbread: shortbread cookie dipped in chocolate and sprinkled with almonds</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p></li></ol><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><br /><strong>\u200bHoliday Pies - 9\" pie crust, served in a white box with bow (optional):</strong></h4><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Apple Pecan Pie<span>\u200b </span></strong><span>- 9\" - </span>House flakey pie crust with house apple pie filling, topped with pecan streusel.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Berry Marzipan Pie</strong><span>\u200b - 9\" - </span>House flakey pie crust with mixed berries and a marzipan streusel, topped with braided pie crust.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Sweet Potato Pie</strong> - 9\u201d - House flakey pie crust with sweet potato filling, topped with cardamom cream .</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Chicken Pot Pie </strong>- 6\u201d - House flakey pie crust with house mornay sauce, roasted chicken, and mixed vegetables. 6\" pie crust.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Buche de Noel  </strong>- delicate vanilla sponge cake with chocolate buttercream and house raspberry jam. Approx. 8\u201d. </h4><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p>",
